<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Simple CSS Selectors</title>
    <style>
        /* Element selector */
        h1 {
            color: red;
        }

        /* ID selector */
        #main {
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Class selector */
        .highlight {
            color: blue;
        }

        /* Group selector */
        h2, h3 {
            color: green;
        }

        /* Universal selector */
        * {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1 id="main">Element & ID Selector</h1>
<p class="highlight">This paragraph uses a class selector.</p>
<h2>Group Selector Example (h2)</h2>
<h3>Group Selector Example (h3)</h3>
<p>Universal selector applies font to all elements.</p>

</body>
</html>
